---
/**
 * LockupPane.astro — reusable "logo lock-up" terminal pane.
 *
 * Extracted from `FactorySoftwarePane.astro` (the original "Software para
 * fábricas" pane, owner request 2026-09-25) so the same effect — logo
 * lock-up joined by an animated dashed connector with a violet "×" badge,
 * intro copy, and a list of shipped projects with a pulsing `.t-led` +
 * status label — can be reused for a second pane (Marmibas + Voxye) without
 * duplicating ~450 lines of markup/styles/motion. `FactorySoftwarePane.astro`
 * and `VoxyePane.astro` are data-only: they hold their own copy and
 * provenance docblocks and render this component with resolved strings.
 *
 * Generalised (P5, owner follow-up 2026-09-25) to also cover a single-logo
 * pane per past role (Devoltec, Capgemini, Cleverpy — see
 * `experiencia/index.astro`), which needs its own company logo instead of
 * the Marmibas tile, a role subheading, stack badges, and a Markdown body
 * (paragraph + checklist) instead of the fixed intro/rows shape:
 *   - `logo` (optional `LockupLogo`) replaces the old hardcoded Marmibas
 *     `<img>`: defaults to `DEFAULT_LOGO` below (the exact same wordmark
 *     markup every existing consumer already renders), so
 *     `FactorySoftwarePane`/`VoxyePane` need no changes. A caller with its
 *     own logo (a role pane) passes `{ src, alt, variant, href? }` instead;
 *     `href` wraps the tile in a link with an auto-generated accessible name
 *     (`"Web de {heading}"`), same convention the old timeline card's own
 *     `aria-label` used.
 *   - `subheading` (optional) renders a smaller line under `heading` (e.g. a
 *     role title).
 *   - `tags` (optional `readonly string[]`) renders a centered row of
 *     `TechBadge` (`variant="subtle"`) right below the lock-up.
 *   - `intro`, `fruitsIntro`, `statusLabel`, `rows` are now all optional
 *     (were required) — a role pane passes none of them and uses the
 *     default `<slot />` instead (see below). `FactorySoftwarePane`/
 *     `VoxyePane` keep passing all four exactly as before.
 *   - A default `<slot />`, rendered inside a `.lockup-pane__body` wrapper,
 *     carries a role pane's rendered MD `<Content />` (one paragraph + a
 *     checklist). The wrapper only renders when the caller actually passed
 *     slot content (`Astro.slots.has('default')`) so the two existing panes
 *     — which pass nothing — get no extra empty `<div>` in their markup.
 *     Slotted Markdown carries no classes of its own, so its `<p>`/`<ul>`/
 *     `<li>` are styled with `:global()` selectors scoped under
 *     `.lockup-pane__body`: the paragraph reuses the `.lockup-pane__copy`
 *     look, each `<li>` reuses the `.lockup-pane__fruit` row's box/border/
 *     spacing but drops the link/logo/status and gets a violet `✓` marker
 *     (`::before`) instead — the checklist isn't clickable, unlike the
 *     project rows below.
 *
 * The left tile defaults to the Marmibas wordmark, but is no longer
 * hardcoded — see `logo`/`DEFAULT_LOGO` above. Only the right-hand partner
 * tile stays a distinct, simpler prop (`partnerLogo`): including whether it
 * needs the wide wordmark treatment (e.g. Plazasys, a wide logotype) or the
 * square icon-mark treatment — pick by checking the source SVG's `viewBox`
 * aspect ratio. The partner is optional: without it the primary tile stands
 * alone and the connector is not rendered (the owner asked for that on the
 * Marmibas/Voxye pane, where Voxye is shown only as a project row; every
 * role pane also omits it — a role pane's `logo` and a `partnerLogo` were
 * never meant to combine).
 *
 * Visual — a `TerminalPane` (`path={path}`, no `index`: a one-off pane, same
 * convention `Footer.astro` uses for `path="contacto"`):
 *   1. `Prompt` decorative command.
 *   2. Eyebrow + `<h2>` heading (+ optional `subheading`), centered.
 *   3. The lock-up: the primary tile × the partner tile, joined by an
 *      animated dashed connector with a violet "×" badge on top (or the
 *      primary tile alone when no `partnerLogo` is given). Desktop:
 *      horizontal `.t-flow` bar. Mobile (≤640px): the lock-up stacks and
 *      swaps to `.t-flow-v` — same dual-bar convention as `ProcessPane.astro`.
 *      Both utilities are already neutralised by the single reduced-motion
 *      block in `motion.css`.
 *   4. Optional stack badges row.
 *   5. The intro sentence, then a "rows intro" line, then each row as a
 *      small link out with its own logo and a pulsing `.t-led` + status
 *      label — or, for a role pane, the default slot's MD body instead.
 *
 * Entrance motion: every entrance `--t-delay` (and the `Prompt`'s own typing
 * delay) adds `delayOffset` (ms, default `0`) so a second pane rendered
 * right after a first one can stagger its entrance instead of animating in
 * lockstep with it. The slotted body's `p`/`li` reveals reuse the `t-fade`/
 * `t-show` keyframes directly (element selectors, since slotted content
 * carries no classes to hook `--t-delay` onto) via a single
 * `--lockup-body-delay` custom property set on the wrapper; both the
 * reduced-motion final-state override (`src/styles/motion.css`, appended
 * next to the other per-component sections — the single-source-of-truth
 * block still lives there, this only adds an entry to it) and the
 * run-on-view pause (`:global(.t-pane.is-waiting ...)` below, mirroring
 * `terminal.css`'s own `.is-waiting` rule for the classed `.t-*` utilities)
 * cover it too.
 *
 * Layout: assumes it is rendered INSIDE a container that already owns its
 * own max-width and inline padding (e.g. `/experiencia`'s `.experience`
 * wrapper, max-width 1080px) — NOT the home panes' full-bleed `.t-pane-gutter`
 * (that utility's own docblock says it's for a pane placed directly in the
 * page flow, not already inside a padded container). Top spacing is the
 * pane's own concern (`topSpacingDesktop`/`topSpacingMobile`, default 64/48
 * matching DESIGN.md §5's spacing scale) via a local, non-global wrapper div
 * — the caller decides the value per placement, the component owns the
 * mechanism.
 */

import TerminalPane from '../terminal/TerminalPane.astro';
import Prompt from '../terminal/Prompt.astro';
import TechBadge from '../ui/TechBadge.astro';

export interface LockupRow {
  slug: string;
  title: string;
  desc: string;
  /** Public path to the row's logo (e.g. `/logos/voxye.svg`). */
  logo: string;
  href: string;
}

/**
 * The pane's primary (left) tile — see the docblock above. Defaults to the
 * Marmibas wordmark (`DEFAULT_LOGO`), so existing "Marmibas × X" consumers
 * don't pass this prop at all.
 */
export interface LockupLogo {
  src: string;
  alt: string;
  /** `wordmark` = dark wide pill (the Marmibas mark). `wide` = light wide
   *  pill (a wide partner wordmark, e.g. Plazasys). `square` = light 48×48
   *  pill (a roughly-square company mark). Pick by checking the source
   *  image's aspect ratio, same rule `partnerLogo.wide` below already used. */
  variant: 'wordmark' | 'square' | 'wide';
  /** When set, the tile becomes a link (`target="_blank"`, accessible name
   *  `"Web de {heading}"`). Omit for a purely decorative tile — the default
   *  Marmibas tile is never a link. */
  href?: string;
}

export interface Props {
  /** Decorative path shown in the pane bar (`~/{path}`). */
  path: string;
  /** Decorative command typed by `Prompt`. */
  promptCommand: string;
  /** `id` for the `<h2>`, wired to `aria-labelledby` on the pane root. */
  headingId: string;
  eyebrow: string;
  heading: string;
  /** Primary (left) tile. Defaults to the Marmibas wordmark — see `LockupLogo`. */
  logo?: LockupLogo;
  /** Smaller line under `heading` (e.g. a role title). Centered, mono, `text-2`. */
  subheading?: string;
  /** Omit to show the primary tile alone, without connector (e.g. `VoxyePane`). */
  partnerLogo?: {
    src: string;
    alt: string;
    /** Wide wordmark tile (e.g. Plazasys) vs. a square icon-mark tile. */
    wide: boolean;
  };
  /** Stack badges (`TechBadge`, `variant="subtle"`), centered, right below the lock-up. */
  tags?: readonly string[];
  intro?: string;
  fruitsIntro?: string;
  statusLabel?: string;
  rows?: readonly LockupRow[];
  /** Added to every entrance `--t-delay`, ms. Defaults to `0`. */
  delayOffset?: number;
  /** Top margin above the pane, desktop px. Defaults to `64`. */
  topSpacingDesktop?: number;
  /** Top margin above the pane, ≤640px px. Defaults to `48`. */
  topSpacingMobile?: number;
}

const DEFAULT_LOGO: LockupLogo = {
  src: '/marmibas-logo.png',
  alt: 'Logo de Marmibas',
  variant: 'wordmark',
};

const LOGO_VARIANT_CLASS: Record<LockupLogo['variant'], string | undefined> = {
  wordmark: 'lockup-pane__logo--wordmark',
  square: undefined,
  wide: 'lockup-pane__logo--wide',
};

const {
  path,
  promptCommand,
  headingId,
  eyebrow,
  heading,
  logo,
  subheading,
  partnerLogo,
  tags,
  intro,
  fruitsIntro,
  statusLabel,
  rows = [],
  delayOffset = 0,
  topSpacingDesktop = 64,
  topSpacingMobile = 48,
} = Astro.props as Props;

const resolvedLogo = logo ?? DEFAULT_LOGO;

// Only wrap the slot in its own container when a caller actually passed
// content — `FactorySoftwarePane`/`VoxyePane` pass none, so they get no
// extra empty `<div>` (see docblock).
const hasBody = Astro.slots.has('default');

const wrapStyle = `--lockup-top-desktop: ${topSpacingDesktop}px; --lockup-top-mobile: ${topSpacingMobile}px;`;
---

<div class="lockup-pane-wrap" style={wrapStyle}>
  <TerminalPane path={path} labelledby={headingId}>
    <div class="lockup-pane">
      <Prompt command={promptCommand} delay={200 + delayOffset} />

      <div class="lockup-pane__heading-block t-show" style={`--t-delay: ${500 + delayOffset}ms;`}>
        <p class="t-comment lockup-pane__eyebrow"># {eyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id={headingId} class="lockup-pane__heading">{heading}</h2>
        {subheading && <p class="lockup-pane__subheading">{subheading}</p>}
      </div>

      <div class="lockup-pane__lockup t-show" style={`--t-delay: ${800 + delayOffset}ms;`}>
        {
          resolvedLogo.href ? (
            <a
              class="lockup-pane__logo-link"
              href={resolvedLogo.href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label={`Web de ${heading}`}
            >
              <img
                class:list={['lockup-pane__logo', LOGO_VARIANT_CLASS[resolvedLogo.variant]]}
                src={resolvedLogo.src}
                alt={resolvedLogo.alt}
                width="48"
                height="48"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </a>
          ) : (
            <img
              class:list={['lockup-pane__logo', LOGO_VARIANT_CLASS[resolvedLogo.variant]]}
              src={resolvedLogo.src}
              alt={resolvedLogo.alt}
              width="48"
              height="48"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          )
        }

        {
          partnerLogo && (
            <>
              <span class="lockup-pane__connector" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="lockup-pane__connector-bar lockup-pane__connector-bar--h t-flow" />
                <span class="lockup-pane__connector-bar lockup-pane__connector-bar--v t-flow-v" />
                <span class="lockup-pane__connector-x">×</span>
              </span>

              <img
                class:list={['lockup-pane__logo', partnerLogo.wide && 'lockup-pane__logo--wide']}
                src={partnerLogo.src}
                alt={partnerLogo.alt}
                width="48"
                height="48"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </>
          )
        }
      </div>

      {
        tags && tags.length > 0 && (
          <ul
            class="lockup-pane__tags t-show"
            role="list"
            style={`--t-delay: ${950 + delayOffset}ms;`}
          >
            {tags.map((tag) => (
              <li>
                <TechBadge label={tag} variant="subtle" />
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        )
      }

      {
        intro && (
          <p class="lockup-pane__copy t-fade" style={`--t-delay: ${1100 + delayOffset}ms;`}>
            {intro}
          </p>
        )
      }

      {
        fruitsIntro && (
          <p class="lockup-pane__fruits-intro t-fade" style={`--t-delay: ${1300 + delayOffset}ms;`}>
            {fruitsIntro}
          </p>
        )
      }

      {
        rows.length > 0 && (
          <ul class="lockup-pane__fruits" role="list">
            {rows.map((row, i) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  class="lockup-pane__fruit t-show"
                  style={`--t-delay: ${1450 + delayOffset + i * 150}ms;`}
                  href={row.href}
                >
                  <span class="lockup-pane__fruit-logo">
                    <img src={row.logo} alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy" />
                  </span>
                  <span class="lockup-pane__fruit-text">
                    <span class="lockup-pane__fruit-title">{row.title}</span>
                    <span class="lockup-pane__fruit-desc">{row.desc}</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="lockup-pane__fruit-status">
                    <span
                      class="t-led"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      style={i > 0 ? `animation-delay: ${i * -600}ms;` : undefined}
                    />
                    {statusLabel}
                  </span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        )
      }

      {
        hasBody && (
          <div class="lockup-pane__body" style={`--lockup-body-delay: ${delayOffset}ms;`}>
            <slot />
          </div>
        )
      }
    </div>
  </TerminalPane>
</div>

<style>
  /* Top spacing only — see docblock. A plain wrapper div owned by this
     component's own scoped style (no `:global()` needed, unlike the
     original `FactorySoftwarePane` which had to reach into the child
     `TerminalPane`'s own root element). */
  .lockup-pane-wrap {
    margin-top: var(--lockup-top-desktop, 64px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lockup-pane-wrap {
      margin-top: var(--lockup-top-mobile, 48px);
    }
  }

  .lockup-pane {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* --- Heading ------------------------------------------------------- */
  .lockup-pane__heading-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lockup-pane__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }

  .lockup-pane__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-0);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lockup-pane__heading {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }

  /* Role line under `heading` (e.g. a job title) — a role pane's own use,
     see docblock. */
  .lockup-pane__subheading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* --- Lock-up: primary × partner ------------------------------------- */
  .lockup-pane__lockup {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lockup-pane__lockup {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }

  /* Official logos are meant for light backgrounds; the light pill
     preserves brand colours over the dark theme. */
  .lockup-pane__logo {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    object-fit: contain;
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--text-0);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* White Marmibas wordmark: dark wide pill so it stays visible. */
  .lockup-pane__logo--wordmark {
    width: auto;
    max-width: 140px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-0);
  }

  /* Wide partner wordmark on the standard light pill. */
  .lockup-pane__logo--wide {
    width: auto;
    max-width: 140px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
  }

  /* Wraps the primary tile only when `logo.href` is set (a role pane) — the
     default Marmibas tile is never a link. */
  .lockup-pane__logo-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .lockup-pane__logo-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-400);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .lockup-pane__connector {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 64px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lockup-pane__connector {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      min-width: 0;
      width: 32px;
      height: 56px;
    }
  }

  /* Dual bar: only one of the two is shown per breakpoint (no background
     shorthand here — `.t-flow`/`.t-flow-v` supply `background-image`). */
  .lockup-pane__connector-bar {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
  }

  .lockup-pane__connector-bar--h {
    display: block;
    inset-inline: 0;
    top: 50%;
    height: 2px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lockup-pane__connector-bar--h {
      display: none;
    }

    .lockup-pane__connector-bar--v {
      display: block;
      inset-block: 0;
      left: 50%;
      width: 2px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  .lockup-pane__connector-x {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--bg-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    color: var(--accent-400);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }

  /* --- Stack badges ----------------------------------------------------- */
  .lockup-pane__tags {
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    max-width: 480px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  /* --- Copy ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .lockup-pane__copy,
  .lockup-pane__fruits-intro {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .lockup-pane__copy {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruits-intro {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  /* --- Rows -------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .lockup-pane__fruits {
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color var(--motion-fast) var(--motion-ease-out),
      box-shadow var(--motion-base) var(--motion-ease-out);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit:hover,
  .lockup-pane__fruit:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--accent-400);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-400);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .lockup-pane__fruit {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      row-gap: 4px;
    }
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-logo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-logo img {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-text {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-0);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .lockup-pane__fruit-status {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--accent-300);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .lockup-pane__fruit-status {
      flex: 1 0 100%;
      padding-left: 52px;
    }
  }

  /* --- Body: a role pane's slotted MD (paragraph + checklist) ----------
     Only rendered when `Astro.slots.has('default')` is true (see script).
     Scoped styles don't reach slotted Markdown markup, so every selector
     below targeting `p`/`ul`/`li` is `:global()` — see docblock. */
  .lockup-pane__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    /* Tighter than the 28px gap between `.lockup-pane`'s own top-level
       sections — paragraph + checklist read as one chunk, not two. */
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .lockup-pane__body :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-1);
    animation: t-fade var(--motion-duration-base) var(--motion-ease-out)
      calc(1100ms + var(--lockup-body-delay, 0ms)) backwards;
  }

  .lockup-pane__body :global(ul) {
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* Same box/border/spacing as `.lockup-pane__fruit`, minus the link/logo/
     status columns — a violet `✓` (`::before`) replaces them. `flex-start`
     (not `.lockup-pane__fruit`'s `center`) because these bullets are full
     sentences that wrap to multiple lines, unlike the short project-row
     titles. */
  .lockup-pane__body :global(li) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-1);
    animation: t-show var(--motion-duration-fast) linear
      calc(1450ms + var(--lockup-body-delay, 0ms)) backwards;
  }

  .lockup-pane__body :global(li)::before {
    content: '✓';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--accent-400);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lockup-pane__body :global(li:nth-child(2)) {
    animation-delay: calc(1600ms + var(--lockup-body-delay, 0ms));
  }

  .lockup-pane__body :global(li:nth-child(3)) {
    animation-delay: calc(1750ms + var(--lockup-body-delay, 0ms));
  }

